:"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001475","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m010-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001475","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m010-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"杵臼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001476","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m010-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001476","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","book_id":"b-shiji-036","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p012","text":"二十一年，宣公後有嬖姬生子款，欲立之，乃殺其太子御寇。御寇素愛厲公子完，完懼禍及己，乃奔齊。齊桓公欲使陳完為卿，完曰：「羈旅之臣，幸得免負檐，君之惠也，不敢當高位。」桓公使為工正。齊懿仲欲妻陳敬仲，卜之，占曰：「是謂鳳皇于飛，和鳴鏘鏘。有媯之後，將育于姜。五世其昌，并于正卿。八世之後，莫之與京。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m012-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001476","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m012-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"嬖姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001479","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m012-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"款","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001480","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m012-0022","start":22,"end":26,"surface":"太子御寇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m012-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"御寇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m012-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"厲公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001466","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m012-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"完","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001109","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m0